-- title:
--   Prime-degree extension inert at v when L⊗_K Kᵥ is a field
-- statement:
--   Let $K$ and $L$ be number fields with $L$ a $K$-algebra, assume the degree $[L:K] = \operatorname{finrank}_K L$ is a prime number, let $\sigma$ be a $K$-algebra automorphism of $L$ with $\sigma \neq 1$, and let $v$ be a height one prime of $\mathcal{O}_K$. Assume that every height one prime $w$ of $\mathcal{O}_L$ lying under $v$ (i.e. with $w \cap \mathcal{O}_K = v$) has ramification index $1$ over $v$, and that the $K_v$-algebra $L \otimes_K K_v$ is a field, where $K_v$ denotes the $v$-adic completion of $K$ and the algebra structure comes from the right factor. The conclusion asserts the existence of a height one prime $w$ of $\mathcal{O}_L$ with $w \cap \mathcal{O}_K = v$, of a $K_v$-algebra isomorphism $e \colon L \otimes_K K_v \to L_w$ onto the $w$-adic completion of $L$, and of a $K_v$-algebra automorphism $\theta$ of $L_w$ such that: every height one prime of $\mathcal{O}_L$ lying under $v$ equals $w$; $e$ intertwines $\theta$ with the ring endomorphism `sigmaTensor` of $L \otimes_K K_v$ obtained by applying $\sigma$ on the left factor and the identity on $K_v$, that is $e(\sigma \otimes \mathrm{id})(a) = \theta(e(a))$ for all $a$; $e(x \otimes 1)$ is the image of $x$ under $L \to L_w$ for every $x \in L$; $\theta$ has order $[L:K]$; the fixed points of $\theta$ are exactly the image of $K_v \to L_w$; $[L_w : K_v] = [L:K]$; and the inertia degree of $w$ over $v$ equals $[L:K]$.
--
--   This packages the inert case of the local behaviour of a prime-degree extension of number fields at an unramified finite place: the hypothesis that $L \otimes_K K_v$ is a field forces a single place $w$ above $v$, with $L_w/K_v$ of degree $[L:K]$ generated by the transported automorphism $\theta$, whose fixed field is $K_v$ and whose residue degree is $f(w\mid v) = [L:K]$. It serves the local analysis of norms used in [`AutomorphicForm.exists_isNormOf_of_isField_tensor_adicCompletion_of_not_isSquare_discr_of_finrank_dvd`](thm.html#AutomorphicForm.exists_isNormOf_of_isField_tensor_adicCompletion_of_not_isSquare_discr_of_finrank_dvd).
